          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049073691-How-to-perform-and-analyze-Smart-Send-Time-tests#h_01HR890742M84PS8JGK9J6KYQC",
          "text": "Create a Smart Send Time test"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049073691-How-to-perform-and-analyze-Smart-Send-Time-tests#h_01HR890742SFV2XDC8DBNQG7TP",
          "text": "Smart Send Time phases"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049073691-How-to-perform-and-analyze-Smart-Send-Time-tests#h_01HR890742D08KC4095Q2VTYSP",
          "text": "Smart Send Time reporting"
